{{!--
  Chart — a line/bar series over a grouped query-time projection (M-T1.3).

  In the SHARED SvelteKit layer rather than in each pack, and that is the
  point: `loader.ts` merges the shared sources into the same template map a
  pack renders from, so this one file serves flowbite AND shadcnSvelte (and any
  pack added later) with no per-pack work.  A pack that wants its own charting
  component can still override `primitive-chart` by name — the shared entry is
  a default, not a ceiling.

  All the geometry lives in `LoomChart.svelte` (emitted by
  `svelte/chart-runtime.ts` only when a page actually charts), so there is no
  charting dependency and nothing here to compute: `rows` arrives already
  projected to the flat `{ label, value }` point shape by
  `svelteTarget.renderChartData`.
--}}
<LoomChart isBar={{#if isLine}}{false}{{else}}{true}{{/if}} label="{{ariaLabel}}" rows={ {{{dataExpr}}} }{{{testidAttr}}} />
